# Full-Stack Billing Application — Implementation Plan

A professional Indian GST-compliant billing application with role-based access, invoice PDF generation, payment tracking, reports, and inventory management.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Frontend | React 18 + Vite |
| Styling | Vanilla CSS (premium dark theme, glassmorphism) |
| Backend | Express.js |
| Database | SQLite via `better-sqlite3` |
| Auth | JWT (`jsonwebtoken` + `bcryptjs`) |
| PDF | `pdfkit` (server-side PDF generation) |
| Charts | Chart.js + react-chartjs-2 |
| Icons | Lucide React |
| Routing | React Router v6 |

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Authentication & Multi-User System

#### [NEW] [auth.js](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/server/routes/auth.js)
- `POST /api/auth/signup` — register user (name, email, password, role)
- `POST /api/auth/login` — login, returns JWT token
- `GET /api/auth/me` — get current user from token
- Roles: **Admin**, **Accountant**, **Sales**
- Password hashing with `bcryptjs`

#### [NEW] [auth middleware](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/server/middleware/auth.js)
- JWT verification middleware
- Role-based access control middleware (`requireRole('Admin')`)

#### [NEW] [Login.jsx](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/src/pages/Login.jsx) / [Signup.jsx](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/src/pages/Signup.jsx)
- Secure login/signup forms, JWT in localStorage

#### [NEW] [AuthContext.jsx](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/src/context/AuthContext.jsx)
- Global auth state, role-based UI, protected routes

---

### 2. Database Schema — [db.js](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/server/db.js)

| Table | Key Columns |
|-------|------------|
| `users` | id, name, email, password_hash, role, created_at |
| `customers` | id, name, email, phone, address, gstin, state |
| `products` | id, name, hsn_sac_code, price, tax_rate, unit, stock_quantity, low_stock_threshold |
| `invoices` | id, invoice_number, customer_id, date, due_date, subtotal, cgst, sgst, igst, total, status, payment_status, amount_paid, created_by |
| `invoice_items` | id, invoice_id, product_id, description, hsn_sac_code, quantity, unit_price, tax_rate, tax_amount, total |
| `payments` | id, invoice_id, amount, date, method, notes |
| `settings` | business_name, address, gstin, logo, phone, email |

---

### 3. Invoice Management (GST-Compliant)

#### [NEW] [invoices.js](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/server/routes/invoices.js)
- Full CRUD with auto GST calculation (CGST+SGST intra-state, IGST inter-state)
- HSN/SAC code per line item, auto invoice numbering
- `GET /:id/pdf` — PDF generation with business logo, line items, taxes
- `POST /:id/email` — send PDF via nodemailer
- `GET /:id/whatsapp` — WhatsApp share link

#### [NEW] [Invoices.jsx](file:///c:/Users/babun/OneDrive/Documents/Billing%20application/src/pages/Invoices.jsx)
- List with search/filter, create/edit form with line items, auto-calc taxes
- Download PDF, Share via Email/WhatsApp buttons, status badges

---

### 4–5. Customer & Product Management + Inventory

- Customer CRUD with GSTIN, address, state fields
- Product CRUD with HSN/SAC, price, tax rate, unit, stock quantity
- Stock auto-decrement on invoice, low stock alerts

---

### 6. Payment Tracking

- Record payments against invoices (partial/full)
- Auto-update payment status (Paid/Unpaid/Partial)
- Payment history, reminder generation

---

### 7. Dashboard — KPI cards (sales daily/monthly/yearly), outstanding, GST summary, revenue chart, recent invoices, low stock alerts

### 8. Reports — Sales (date filter), GST (CGST/SGST/IGST), Outstanding — tabbed view with date pickers

### 9. Settings — Business info + logo upload (multer), shown on PDF invoices

---

## Role-Based Access Matrix

| Feature | Admin | Accountant | Sales |
|---------|-------|-----------|-------|
| Dashboard | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (limited) |
| Manage Users | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Invoices (CRUD) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (own only) |
| Customers (CRUD) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Products (CRUD) | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ (view only) |
| Payments | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Reports | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Settings | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Inventory | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ (view only) |

## Verification Plan

1. Start `npm run dev:full`, navigate to `http://localhost:5173`
2. Test signup/login → verify JWT auth and role-based access
3. Add customer + product → create invoice → download PDF → verify GST calculations
4. Record payment → verify status updates → check dashboard
5. Verify reports, inventory alerts, settings, and responsive design
